4080 REM RULE:
4090 REM   STARTS WITH "FNM_"
4100 REM   ENDS WITH ":"
4110 REM   CONTAINS NO FURTHER "_" FROM POSITION 5
4120 REM ==========================================================
4130 LET E = 0
